sequenceDiagram
  actor Manager
  participant Weather as Weather adapter
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Flow as Workflow
  participant Message as Messaging

  API->>Weather: Fetch observations, forecast, and alerts
  Weather-->>API: Versioned evidence
  API->>DB: Open disruption watch with evidence
  Manager->>API: Approve human decision and remedies
  API->>DB: Persist decision and per-target tasks
  API->>Flow: Start resumable execution
  loop Each affected booking
    Flow->>DB: Apply reschedule, credit, refund, or exception idempotently
    Flow->>Message: Queue approved communication
  end
  Flow->>DB: Resolve when every target has outcome
